OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driver dies in
OL,4,Acrash with fence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi driver has died after crashing
OL,7,Finto a garden fence.
OL,9,FHumberside Police received reports of
OL,10,Fthe incident on Hanley Road, in Hull,
OL,11,Fat about 09:50 GMT on Saturday 14
OL,12,FNovember and said the driver of a blue
OL,13,FFord Tourneo Connect taxi, a
OL,14,F55-year-old man, died at the scene.
OL,16,FThe force said it believed he had been
OL,17,Finvolved in an "altercation" on the
OL,18,Fsame road shortly before and a
OL,19,F62-year-old man had been arrested. He
OL,20,Fremained in custody, it added.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
