OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driver dies in
OL,4,Acrash with fence
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Leanne Murphy said the
OL,7,Finvestigation was in its early stages,
OL,8,Fand appealed for anyone who was in the
OL,9,Farea, witnessed the altercation or saw
OL,10,Fthe Ford prior to the crash to come
OL,11,Fforward.
